DTSTART:20270522T180000Z
DTEND:20270522T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261016T231749Z
UID:2298025
DESCRIPTION:<p><em>Dirty Dancing</em>\, the story that awakened a generati
 on\, is back in a new stage production and heading to Broadway for the fir
 st time.<br /><br />Get ready to have the time of your life! Based on Lion
 sgate&rsquo\;s beloved film written by Eleanor Bergstein\, <em>Dirty Danci
 ng: The Musical</em> is the feel-good escape you&rsquo\;ve been craving\, 
 alive with the pulse of electrified dancing\, the thrill of secret encount
 ers\, and the allure of forbidden romance. Set to live music from the orig
 inal film you love\, Baby and Johnny bring to life the summer that changed
  everything.&zwj\;<br /><br />Your reservation at Kellerman&rsquo\;s await
 s!</p>
LOCATION:Lena Horne Theatre\, 256 West 47th Street\, New York NY 10036
END:VEVENT
